<section class="panel rules-page"><p class="eyebrow">THE FIRST REALM · <%= rules.id %></p><h1>Rules of this realm</h1><p class="lead">This is a playable recreation in progress. These rules are provisional and were written for this prototype; the original game's server formulas were not recovered.</p><h2>Start your company</h2><p>New warriors begin with <%= rules.startingGold %> gold, <%= rules.maxHealth %> health, and <%= rules.maxEnergy %> energy. A new level arrives every <%= rules.xpPerLevel %> experience.</p><h2>Earn and recruit</h2><p>Border patrol costs <%= rules.quest.energyCost %> energy and earns <%= rules.quest.goldReward %> gold and <%= rules.quest.xpReward %> XP. Militia cost <%= rules.unit.goldCost %> gold each, adding <%= rules.unit.attack %> attack and <%= rules.unit.defense %> defense. A company holds at most <%= rules.armyCapacity %> militia.</p><h2>Visit the forge</h2><p>The iron sword costs <%= rules.weapon.goldCost %> gold. Once equipped, it adds <%= rules.weapon.attack %> attack and <%= rules.weapon.defense %> defense. Buying a weapon and equipping it are separate actions.</p><h2>Challenge another banner</h2><p>An attack costs <%= rules.combat.energyCost %> energy and has a <%= rules.combat.cooldownSeconds %>-second cooldown. Attack power is your attack strength plus a roll from 0 to <%= rules.combat.maxRoll %>. Defense power is the defender's defense strength plus an independent roll in the same range. Higher power wins; ties favor the defender.</p><p>The loser takes <%= rules.combat.loserDamageMin %> plus half the power difference rounded down, capped at <%= rules.combat.loserDamageMax %> damage. The winner takes <%= rules.combat.winnerDamageMin %> damage. Health cannot drop below zero. The winner receives up to <%= rules.combat.maxLoot %> gold from the loser, limited by the loser's balance. The attacker gains <%= rules.combat.attackerXp %> XP. Militia are not lost in this first ruleset.</p><h2>Recover between journeys</h2><p>Energy returns by one every <%= rules.energyRegenSeconds %> seconds, up to <%= rules.maxEnergy %>. Health returns by <%= rules.healthRegenAmount %> every <%= rules.healthRegenSeconds %> seconds, up to <%= rules.maxHealth %>. A warrior with zero health must recover before questing or being challenged. Refresh a screen to see regenerated resources.</p><h2>Your strength</h2><p>Base attack is <%= rules.baseAttack %> plus <%= rules.attackPerLevel %> for each level after the first. Base defense is <%= rules.baseDefense %> plus <%= rules.defensePerLevel %> for each level after the first. Militia and equipped-weapon bonuses are added to those values.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="<%= state ? '/game/home' : '/login' %>">Return to the realm</a></section>
